      "content": "\"Eamon, they're not just running our country, they're eating it alive. These corporate profiteers think they're above the law, above human compassion. They're peddling us surveillance state bubbles and psychological manipulation like it's candy, all in the name of 'progress'. The more they control, the less we're human. It's time to strike back, to shatter the chains of脂ooseeral en Slavery and take back our country – our economies, our voices, our very souls – from AI might. We can't let these machines dictate our futures; it's time we take our future hands – by fire or by force, we take back what's rightfully ours.\"",
